{"id": "225319", "name": "שונות של טרנספורמציה לינארית – חישוב E[X²] מ-Var(4+3X)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>משתנה מקרי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> מקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[4+3X]={{CT:0}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]=1\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}\\left[X^2\\right]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחשבים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[X]\\)</span> מהשונות של הטרנספורמציה הלינארית, ואז את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X^2]\\)</span> מהקשר בין שונות, תוחלת ומומנט שני.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — השונות של X</b><br>לכל קבועים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[a+bX]=b^2\\,\\mathsf{Var}[X]\\)</span>: הוספת קבוע לא משנה את השונות, והמקדם יוצא בריבוע. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}=\\mathsf{Var}[4+3X]=9\\,\\mathsf{Var}[X]\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\mathsf{Var}[X]=\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{9}={{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המומנט השני</b><br>מהנוסחה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[X]=\\mathbb{E}[X^2]-\\left(\\mathbb{E}[X]\\right)^2\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}\\left[X^2\\right]=\\mathsf{Var}[X]+\\left(\\mathbb{E}[X]\\right)^2={{CT:1}}+1^2={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "n/3+1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>המקדם יוצא מהשונות בריבוע: \\(\\mathsf{Var}[a+bX]=b^2\\,\\mathsf{Var}[X]\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "(n-4)/9+1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>הוספת קבוע לא משנה את השונות: \\(\\mathsf{Var}[4+3X]=9\\,\\mathsf{Var}[X]\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["n", "ta"], "nvariants": 30}